 Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000019FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: We Go Narrator,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,300,300,27,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:01:59.04,0:02:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry...Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.47,0:02:02.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry and apologize already!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.75,0:02:05.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does this guy have a death wish?Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.96,0:02:13.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think you're starting to see how reckless you were!Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.65,0:02:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's probably why you're too scared to even talk!Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.42,0:02:20.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just moments ago,Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.72,0:02:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a long-nosed man and a woman with long hair had the audacity to cross us.Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.03,0:02:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That put our captain in a foul mood, so be quick and apologize.Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.55,0:02:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Prostrate yourself!Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.24,0:02:39.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, this one little mistake will end up costing ya your life.Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.75,0:02:43.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our captain has an itchy trigger finger.Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.16,0:02:50.45,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kneel on the ground already! This is Straw Hat Luffy you're dealing with!Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.45,0:02:53.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Does he want to get killed? Apologize!Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.27,0:02:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.43,0:02:57.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm in a hurry, so...Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.86,0:03:01.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.83,0:03:08.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.98,0:03:11.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That does it!Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.19,0:03:53.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, did he do something just now?Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.97,0:04:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna go to sea. I wanna fish.Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't, crap for brains!Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.03,0:04:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why not?! And why should I listen to you?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.97,0:04:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm walking with you because I want to?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.12,0:04:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll cause me more trouble if you go wandering off again!Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.41,0:04:18.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You muddled moss ball!Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.64,0:04:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be here soon, so just come to the ship with me!Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.51,0:04:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.35,0:04:28.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good grief.Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.27,0:04:33.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with the seventh trying to boss around the first?Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.19,0:04:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you ranking us in the order we got here?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.33,0:04:40.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You being the first was a fluke, so don't let it go to your head!Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.90,0:04:44.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my bad... number seven.Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.84,0:04:46.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, you asked for it!Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.97,0:04:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I trained my legs in hell for two years!Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.24,0:04:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on! I'll cut you clean in half!Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.22,0:05:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain...!Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.73,0:05:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.11,0:05:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.42,0:05:07.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.19,0:05:11.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I missed you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.40,0:05:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.90,0:05:14.80,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.42,0:05:16.97,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.97,0:05:19.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.30,0:05:19.07,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.84,0:05:25.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S... Sogeking?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.56,0:05:25.11,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.11,0:05:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool!Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys have changed a lot in the last two years!Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.71,0:05:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet you all got stronger!Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.98,0:05:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.18,0:05:36.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats.Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are they doing on the street?Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well... you see, just now...Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.39,0:05:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Avoid eye contact. You don't want to fight them.Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.67,0:05:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.46,0:05:50.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.30,0:05:52.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know!Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.27,0:05:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I felt chills all over my body!Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of trick did he pull?Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.58,0:06:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! We have another problem.Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.25,0:06:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The thing is, Cocoa got–Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.75,0:06:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I mean...Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.32,0:06:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin got...Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.26,0:06:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that, Zoro?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.55,0:06:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin got abducted?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.05,0:06:16.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It happened right before our eyes.Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.43,0:06:19.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right! This is serious, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.00,0:06:22.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She could have been kidnapped... just like Camie was!Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.53,0:06:23.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.21,0:06:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who did it?Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.50,0:06:29.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... I haven't the foggiest.Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.72,0:06:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain,Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.84,0:06:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think the people who want something from the real Robin took Cocoa by mistake.Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.15,0:06:38.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's possible.Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.46,0:06:44.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She looked so much like the real Robin... That did not go in our favor.Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop whispering!Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.32,0:06:48.33,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.99,0:06:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh well, let's leave it at that.Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.23,0:06:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's her fate.Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?! Okay, Captain.Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Robin has been abducted!Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.00,0:07:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been wondering, what is this creature?Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.61,0:07:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.89,0:07:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't joke about that!Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.58,0:07:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can he speak? Is he a stuffed animal?Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it back, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.15,0:07:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget about that thing!Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.70,0:07:27.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just meet at Grove 46 with the hundred recruits we found here!Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.43,0:07:29.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That long-nosed man...Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.44,0:07:31.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That orange-haired woman...Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.78,0:07:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That brat with the cloak and giant backpack...Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find those three,Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.84,0:07:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and make them regret crossing Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.65,0:07:45.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Roger! – Roger!Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.05,0:07:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should try not to kill them before bringing them there.Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.69,0:07:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's use this opportunity to show what happens when you cross the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.89,0:07:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.19,0:07:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.63,0:08:00.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have these last two years warped your personalities so much?Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.03,0:08:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.43,0:08:05.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I... feel so sad...Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I can do is cry!Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.90,0:08:10.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Again, what is this creature?Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.31,0:08:12.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about Robin?Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.78,0:08:14.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't you guys say something?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.37,0:08:16.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? How can he talk?Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.96,0:08:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toys today are pretty advanced!Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.38,0:08:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I misjudged you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.42,0:08:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna save her even if I have to do it alone!Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.33,0:08:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.23,0:08:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was there a falling out?Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.63,0:08:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's them...Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.41,0:08:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it.Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.27,0:08:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates may look radically different from two years ago,Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.87,0:08:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but no one else has a weird pet like that!Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're...Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.35,0:08:58.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats! They're alive!Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.76,0:09:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Grove 47. We've identified the pirate group; it's the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.71,0:09:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,Apparently, all the pirates that the Straw HatsDialogue: 50,0:09:13.74,0:09:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,recruited from this island are gathering at Grove 46!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.81,0:09:19.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood! Roger that!Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.64,0:09:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the civilians immediately!Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.59,0:09:23.48,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger that!Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.48,0:09:27.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates are gathering at Grove 46!Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.66,0:09:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The target is the Straw Hats! We're raiding the lawless area!Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.15,0:09:32.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready for action!Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.99,0:09:37.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Close in on them from  Groves 40, 42, and 44!Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.76,0:09:40.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Backup from G-1 is on the way!Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Sentomaru-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.14,0:09:51.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going first!Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.35,0:09:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take PX-5 and PX-7 with me!Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.11,0:09:59.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...? You're deploying the pacifista?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.25,0:10:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of you are underestimating the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.07,0:10:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been two years since the war now.Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.60,0:10:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must have gotten stronger!Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.43,0:10:17.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're nothing like the rookies that normally come to this island!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.51,0:10:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The meaning of...Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.07,0:10:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Kuma's actions from two years ago remains a mystery.Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.63,0:10:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, I observed how he behaved after losing his personality,Dialogue: 50,0:10:35.39,0:10:41.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,leading me to conclude that the Straw Hats would reunite here one day!Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.19,0:10:44.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.91,0:11:00.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.87,0:11:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did they take her?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.52,0:11:11.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn! Damn! Damn! Damn!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.48,0:11:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to everybody?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.82,0:11:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Zoro, Nami, Sanji, Franky...Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.67,0:11:25.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They used to be so compassionate!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.40,0:11:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin gets abducted and he says "leave it at that"?Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.74,0:11:34.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too cruel!Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.22,0:11:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just... what have I been working toward for the past two years?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.53,0:11:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And for whom?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.49,0:11:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over here!Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew it was Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.20,0:12:00.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.96,0:12:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh man, you got so big!Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.10,0:12:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you're a comfy ride now!Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.94,0:12:08.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You been doin' alright?Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.28,0:12:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.15,0:12:13.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right! You're much softer than before!Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.65,0:12:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.82,0:12:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.99,0:12:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami?Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.07,0:12:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's me.Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.59,0:12:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.14,0:12:29.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you guys, but we're running out of time!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin's in trouble!Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.31,0:12:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean they're impostors?Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why there are two Namis?Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.35,0:12:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.53,0:12:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin's eluded the government for 20 years!Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.29,0:12:53.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's unthinkable that she could get stuffed into a sack and taken so easily.Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.88,0:12:54.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see!Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.91,0:12:57.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought there was something wrong...Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She didn't even smell familiar!Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm pissed off now!Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.76,0:13:07.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What gives?! Why would they pose as us?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.37,0:13:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare they imitate us!Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.80,0:13:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if we're...Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as if... as if...Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.81,0:13:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as if we're the real deal, those jerks!Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.31,0:13:21.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you so happy about?Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.57,0:13:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess having impersonators was bound to happen, what with our captain's fame.Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.27,0:13:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How should I sign my autograph?Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! I've already settled on mine!Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.46,0:13:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You get that this isn't the good kind of fame, right?Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.07,0:13:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.15,0:13:47.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.81,0:13:53.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man! We lucked into the real Straw Hats' pet, but we've already lost it!Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.55,0:13:56.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch! My side!Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.22,0:13:58.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.02,0:14:02.49,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That strange creature used to be with the real Straw Hats?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.95,0:14:04.83,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so earlier?Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.83,0:14:06.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Go and bring him back here!Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.82,0:14:08.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.30,0:14:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll never find him if we don't know where to look for him!Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.44,0:14:16.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've completely lost him! Sabaody Archipelago is too big!Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.06,0:14:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch! My side! It hurts!Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.41,0:14:24.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't run anymore! Let's... Let's just walk.Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.18,0:14:30.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hancock was right. I need this mustache.Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.62,0:14:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She told me to stay outta trouble.Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.97,0:14:37.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look!Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.17,0:14:40.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that the brat Captain was talking about?Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.00,0:14:43.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You call that a brat? More like a cheerful old man.Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.24,0:14:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Hey, guys!Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.94,0:14:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, bro. Let's go for a walk.Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.28,0:14:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just come quietly, and there won't be trouble.Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.65,0:15:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our captain is very angry. Give up on living a long life.Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.65,0:15:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Are you too scared to talk?Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.47,0:15:07.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Sanji, aren't you?Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.46,0:15:07.47,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.47,0:15:08.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So then you're Zoro!Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.89,0:15:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, guys!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.38,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wha...?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.43,0:15:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, it's been a while! Hasn't it?Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.59,0:15:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah! So let's get going!Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.87,0:15:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, everybody's here already?Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.59,0:15:23.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you all waiting!Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.81,0:15:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's mistaken us?Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.21,0:15:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like that really matters!Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.90,0:15:35.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We just gotta get him to Captain!Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Grove 46.Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.46,0:15:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More and more rookies keep joining the Straw Hats and showing up here.Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.17,0:16:01.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see four captains.Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.51,0:16:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,With a bounty of 92 million belly,Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.55,0:16:06.05,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Albion "the Maimed."Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.92,0:16:08.87,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,With a bounty of 88 million belly,Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.87,0:16:10.79,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Lip "Service" Doughty.Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.98,0:16:15.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-And... there are some super rookies...Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.99,0:16:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,The captain of the Caribou Pirates.Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.27,0:16:20.63,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,With a bounty of 210 million belly,Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.63,0:16:22.57,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,"Wet-Haired" Caribou!Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.26,0:16:25.55,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Plus his brother and co-captain.Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.55,0:16:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,With a bounty of 190 million belly,Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.98,0:16:30.21,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,"Blood Splatter" Coribou!Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.68,0:16:43.79,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.79,0:16:49.59,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore!Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.59,0:16:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. The Navy, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.50,0:16:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it.Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.59,0:16:54.56,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore!Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.56,0:16:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't push!Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.50,0:16:58.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soul King! Come back to us!Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.56,0:16:58.74,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore!Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.74,0:17:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need a little more time.Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.49,0:17:04.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes... My fans are calling for an encore...Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.74,0:17:04.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.71,0:17:09.98,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.98,0:17:14.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and since they won't stop, I have to go back on.Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.98,0:17:14.52,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Encore! Encore! Encore!Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting, everybody!Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.91,0:17:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it! Show's over!Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.55,0:17:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy's here? But why...?Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.75,0:17:50.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acting captain of the Rumbar Pirates: "Humming Swordsman" Brook!Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.25,0:17:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bounty: 33 million belly!Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.76,0:17:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We suspect that you are this very pirate!Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.34,0:17:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Furthermore,Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.92,0:18:03.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,intelligence says you're currently part of Straw Hat Luffy's pirate crew!Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.47,0:18:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soul King Brook–Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.67,0:18:07.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rather, Brook the pirate,Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.97,0:18:10.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're under arrest!Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.34,0:18:15.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way... Our beloved Brook isn't...!Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soul King is a criminal?Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.88,0:18:19.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a pirate?Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.63,0:18:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I heard Straw Hat Luffy was dead!Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.45,0:18:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all over, Brook.Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.39,0:18:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought that you might be behind this,Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.82,0:18:31.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Manager.Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.16,0:18:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you told me backstage about your early retirement plans,Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.16,0:18:36.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you gave me a real shock.Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.97,0:18:42.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've become so popular, we were primed to make a ton of money.Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.21,0:18:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've betrayed us, and our little business venture is over.Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.38,0:18:54.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's die together, Soul King.Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.79,0:19:00.69,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Cool!Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.69,0:19:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?! His body is amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.97,0:19:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're like a robot!Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.41,0:19:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you shoot beams... or missiles?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.91,0:19:19.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you combine with something?Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.91,0:19:21.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally!Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.21,0:19:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shouldering men’s passions and dreamsDialogue: 50,0:19:23.81,0:19:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While moving into action is he,Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.75,0:19:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The one I call,Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robot! Robot!Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.39,0:19:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rein it in, Chopper! This much excitement is deadly!Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.78,0:19:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Franky,Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.42,0:19:47.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can't do precision work with those huge hands, can you?Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.47,0:19:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were saying something?Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.91,0:19:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check it out! A hand!Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.43,0:19:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A hand came out of his hand!Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.11,0:19:58.80,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Combining!Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.23,0:19:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.62,0:20:01.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.47,0:20:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look great!Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.45,0:20:06.49,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Combine! Combine!Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that weirdo's body?Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.95,0:20:12.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I don't understand.Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.20,0:20:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is the coating?Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.50,0:20:19.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My nose. Press my nose.Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.44,0:20:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your nose?Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.24,0:20:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Press and hold it down. At least three seconds.Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.20,0:20:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please press the nose at least three seconds.Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.21,0:20:29.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He repeated it! Like a robot!Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.30,0:20:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So exciting... So exciting... So exciting...Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.27,0:20:34.68,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,One, two, three...Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.89,0:20:37.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hair!Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.42,0:20:39.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hair...!Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you control your hair?Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.23,0:20:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.33,0:20:48.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Wow! – Wow!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.06,0:20:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Nami! Wassup?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.73,0:20:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hey...Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was he doing for two years?Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.11,0:20:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I see your weapons? Can I?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.95,0:21:07.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold your horses! That's the main event. Wait till Luffy gets here too-mecha.Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.55,0:21:09.19,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He moved like a robot!Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.19,0:21:11.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He added "mecha" at the end!Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.95,0:21:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys.Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.03,0:21:17.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh-san! Shakky!Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.93,0:21:21.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to interrupt your reunion but...Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.78,0:21:25.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the archipelago is in an uproar right now.Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.07,0:21:26.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate Brook!Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.26,0:21:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drop your instrument and put your hands in the air!Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Band.Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.41,0:21:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Backup singers and dancers!Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.58,0:21:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to support me for one more song!Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.42,0:21:46.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.32,0:21:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My music's got power now!Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.89,0:21:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.83,0:21:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all over for you, Brook.Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.03,0:21:58.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Manager, thank you for everything these past two years.Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.47,0:22:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And extra thanks for bringing me to this archipelago.Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.81,0:22:09.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island holds the sad memory of our crushing defeat...Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.19,0:22:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and it's where we'll begin anew!Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.41,0:22:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a musician.Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.12,0:22:19.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My role on the Straw Hat crew is to make the adventure a little more lively.Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.04,0:22:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People think Straw Hat Luffy is dead?Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.25,0:22:25.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's nonsense!Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.46,0:22:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell this to the whole world:Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.10,0:22:31.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirate Straw Hat Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.53,0:22:34.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is alive!Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.71,0:22:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One day, he'll rule the world's seas as the pirate king!Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.61,0:22:45.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Main office...? Can you hear me? It's news...! Big news!Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.31,0:22:50.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His departure shouldn't be a quiet one! Oh, baby!Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.59,0:22:54.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soul King!Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.02,0:22:58.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send me your love all the way down to the bone!Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.97,0:23:03.47,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.37,0:23:03.47,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This song is dedicated to my dear friends.Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.47,0:23:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This my final soul... Listen up!Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.04,0:23:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.80,0:23:12.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san, let's go to the New World!Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.11,0:23:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You numbskull! I said the show is ov–Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.68,0:23:15.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shove it, Navy!Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.28,0:23:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us hear one more song!Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.65,0:23:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let him sing!Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.15,0:23:25.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let him! All that matters to us is that he's Soul King!Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.47,0:23:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See? Music is always on your side!Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four...Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.17,0:23:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"New World."Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.67,0:23:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,This is Grove 46.Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.87,0:23:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,There's at least a hundred pirates here now.Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.12,0:23:58.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they've all joined Straw Hat Luffy's crew, then this is a real emer–Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.19,0:24:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?! Answer!Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.00,0:24:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not good! Tell the reinforcements to hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.63,0:24:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well...Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.57,0:24:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had my suspicions, but if it isn't a marine!Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.48,0:24:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh my, oh my!Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.94,0:24:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what do we have here?Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.84,0:24:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh! Don't tell me...Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.73,0:24:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did this little marine just inform the Navy?Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.13,0:24:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.37,0:24:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a Navy man.Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.44,0:24:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-No, I haven't called them yet!Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.90,0:24:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was just about to...Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.67,0:24:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, not that. Don't even think about it.Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.24,0:25:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, blood will get everywhere...Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.07,0:25:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The blood of you and your friends!Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.52,0:25:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Coribou?Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.36,0:25:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I'm sorry, brother, I'm so sorry!Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.73,0:25:13.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm over here, you fool!Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.49,0:25:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.07,0:25:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still the wrong way,Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.47,0:25:20.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you dim-witted simpleton!Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.20,0:25:22.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Marine Slayer Caribou...Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.30,0:25:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough jokes.Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.83,0:25:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– He did it! – True to his reputation.Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.67,0:26:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, God! Have mercy!Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.98,0:26:08.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This silly Navy soldier reached for his weapon and attempted to kill me!Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.22,0:26:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy on him!Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.42,0:26:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, God! So sorry!Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.01,0:26:18.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bury him, Coribou!Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.33,0:26:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This marine is a sinful man... and must be buried alive!Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.43,0:26:24.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.20,0:26:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta dig, gotta dig...Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.06,0:26:29.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait a minute! Don't do this!Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.87,0:26:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was never a call to the Navy...!Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.06,0:26:31.87,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm diggin' a hole, just diggin it up...Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.87,0:26:33.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Caribou!Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.87,0:26:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.15,0:26:41.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just dispose of that pissant marine somewhere.Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.89,0:26:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here comes Captain Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.89,0:26:50.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys, look around you!Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.89,0:26:52.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You probably don't know each other,Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.77,0:26:55.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but all of you work for me now...Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.40,0:26:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as a part of the Straw Hat Pirate crew!Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.14,0:27:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means when I become the king of the pirates,Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.91,0:27:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that'll make you the king's crew!Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.65,0:27:12.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To make that happen, from now on,Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.01,0:27:15.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll need to commit both body and soulDialogue: 50,0:27:15.27,0:27:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and risk your life for me in battle!Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.16,0:27:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like a dream! He's taken on all three strongholds of the World Government,Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.19,0:27:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby, Impel Down, Navy Headquarters!Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.03,0:27:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd be lucky to serve under such a peerless pirate!Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.24,0:27:37.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll become a strong contender for the title of king of the pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.87,0:27:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Might as well jump on the bandwagon!Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.97,0:27:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, looks like quite the turnout.Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.62,0:27:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that it?Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.22,0:27:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see everybody!Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.56,0:27:57.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.73,0:28:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We asked you to assemble here because...Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.83,0:28:09.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I, your beloved boss, have had my honor tarnished!Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.74,0:28:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those responsible are somewhere on this archipelago!Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.01,0:28:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need you to track them down and drag them here!Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.50,0:28:24.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Consider it done, Boss!Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.85,0:28:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive those fools!Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.02,0:28:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, two years can really change a person.Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.79,0:28:34.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys don't talk much now, do you?Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.66,0:28:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like this guy with the mustache does know the real Straw Hats.Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.94,0:28:42.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is he?Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.44,0:28:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beats me, but he'll notice if we talk too much.Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.31,0:28:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we gotta do is take him to the captain.Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.67,0:28:50.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.41,0:28:53.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't remember you two ever getting along this well before.Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.68,0:28:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's been two years after all.Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.29,0:29:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look different too.Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.29,0:29:02.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you also in disguise?Dialogue: 50,0:29:08.03,0:29:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.67,0:29:12.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy?Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.40,0:29:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, they think those impostors are the real Straw HatsDialogue: 50,0:29:16.58,0:29:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and have started mobilizing.Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.11,0:29:22.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had them wiretapped, so there's no mistake.Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.85,0:29:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I spoke to Brook through a transponder snail and told him what's going on.Dialogue: 50,0:29:28.48,0:29:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He should be heading this way soon.Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.79,0:29:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, so he's gonna abandon stardom?Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.16,0:29:36.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got real backbone.Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.73,0:29:39.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-chan, you're the navigator, aren't you?Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.70,0:29:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you how to operate the coated ship, so listen carefully.Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.58,0:29:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.10,0:29:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.24,0:29:48.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's this?Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.27,0:29:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all tense and stuff now.Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.17,0:29:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, Rayleigh, Luffy isn't here yet!Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.68,0:29:55.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.04,0:29:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.05,0:29:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.71,0:30:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Call me "big boss," fool!Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.22,0:30:07.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We couldn't find the real pet, but isn't this the guy you're looking for?Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.86,0:30:10.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah.Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.79,0:30:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy has already arrived.Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.17,0:30:19.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.44,0:30:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gave Sanji a baby transponder snail when he stopped by earlier.Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.91,0:30:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's with Zoro now.Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.41,0:30:27.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's good.Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.64,0:30:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys have to hurry— the Navy will be here soon.Dialogue: 50,0:30:32.01,0:30:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only Monkey-chan that we can't reach.Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.95,0:30:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But your crew should keep this vivre card on you.Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.46,0:30:41.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll lead him right to you.Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.82,0:30:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grove 42 is right by the sea, making it the perfect place.Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.53,0:30:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sail on over there for your rendezvous!Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.20,0:30:53.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a little hectic, but after you all got through these two years...Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.24,0:30:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's finally time for a new beginning!Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:58.64,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Island of New BeginningsDialogue: 1,0:01:53.30,0:01:58.64,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Island of New BeginningsDialogue: 0,0:09:08.93,0:09:12.67,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Naval Station, Grove 66Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.93,0:09:12.67,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Naval Station, Grove 66Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:05.62,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Sabaody Archipelago Grove 35Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.98,0:11:05.62,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Sabaody Archipelago Grove 35Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:45.13,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Rendezvous Point, Grove 46Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.69,0:15:45.13,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Rendezvous Point, Grove 46Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.51,0:16:06.05,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Albion "the Maimed" Bounty:   92 MillionDialogue: 1,0:16:01.51,0:16:06.05,Captions-PTS,,0,0,0,,Albion "the Maimed" Bounty:   92 MillionDialogue: 0,0:16:01.51,0:16:06.05,Captions,,0,0,0,,m 8.2 10.1 b 11.8 10.1 25.6 10.5 28.1 9.5 32.2 7.8 32.3 2.5 40.2 0.6 42.9 0 52.7 0.4 49.1 5.5 47.4 7.9 43.5 5.9 41.2 6.3 38.6 6.7 37.7 8.2 36.2 10.1 44.1 11.3 52.5 15.8 51.5 25.1 51.3 27.1 50.7 29.3 49.5 30.9 47.8 33.1 44.6 34.7 42.2 36.1 56.7 38.5 59.4 54.2 49.2 61.5 42.2 66.5 34.8 64.1 31.4 66.1 27.4 68.5 27.7 75.1 20.2 77.5 15.2 79 7.2 77.9 3.5 73.9 0 70 0.3 64.1 8.2 65.1 8.2 65.1 8.2 10.1 8.2 10.1 m 28.2 16.1 b 28.2 16.1 17.2 16.1 17.2 16.1 17.2 16.1 17.2 33.1 17.2 33.1 17.2 33.1 28.2 33.1 28.2 33.1 28.2 33.1 28.2 16.1 28.2 16.1 m 33.2 33.1 b 36.2 32.6 39.4 32 41.5 29.5 45.5 24.6 41.6 17.8 33.2 17.1 33.2 17.1 33.2 33.1 33.2 33.1 m 28.2 39.1 b 28.2 39.1 17.2 39.1 17.2 39.1 17.2 39.1 17.2 59.1 17.2 59.1 17.2 59.1 28.2 59.1 28.2 59.1 28.2 59.1 28.2 39.1 28.2 39.1 m 33.2 59.1 b 3